PATCH NOTES:
Fixed stalemate not occurring when a piece changes row.
Fixed double check when a queen whom faces its own pawn which faces the opposing queen capture checks.
Pinned pieces can no longer move to other attack vectors.
Fixed discovered check not properly initiating a check event.
Added a way to get a enpassant piece if there is one.
Added a way to get the total number of moves.
Added a way to get the total number of moves until 50 move draw.
Added a way to know which castling is available based on castle vector.

